{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12201210","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12201210","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1220121001:0":{"text":"辺りを見渡しても、遠くから波の音が聞こえてくるだけで、そこには誰もいなかった。","source_cn":"环视四周，只有遥远的海浪声，周围空无一人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06F78747A218DF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220121002:1":{"text":"ジョ、ジョナサンさんが消えた！？さっきまで間違いなくここに！","source_cn":"乔、乔纳森先生不见了？！他刚刚明明还在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x090EE6294490034A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220121003:1":{"text":"セシリアさんを連れてくると伝えておいたのに……どうしていなくなっちゃったんだろう？ジョナサンさんもセシリアさんに会いたいはずなのに……","source_cn":"我们离开时说过会带塞西莉亚来见他……为什么他离开了？他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E18C5531891CEB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220121004:1":{"text":"もしかするとセシリアさんに今の自分の姿を見られたくなかったのかも……","source_cn":"可能是，不想让塞西莉亚见到他现在的样子吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E8206E42A3ED4A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220121005:1":{"text":"……まったく！とんでもないバカなんだから！","source_cn":"……真是个彻头彻尾的大笨蛋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44BE6D3DA10CB026","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title